        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Gaanphiu ganchuang kanlou mei Puh guang supui ram,",
            "Kandi lungh rianra rianriu mei guai,",
            "Panti muang zing mei naidat lak khe,",
            "Kapma tam mei nai dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "Lily munpuang le’ tik dailiang mei ram,",
            "Lauziu nah le kanlou mei bampui ram,",
            "Tingkao chaeng khakle than mei nun",
            "Hou khang ai ning e.",
            "",
            "2. Phang zau lo’ tik daimei ram tang mei nun guai rui,",
            "Thanpui khuan gaimei lu tei suan na",
            "Kandi champan thiu rui kao sini,",
            "Nzian na ai guang dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "3. Kanloumei nun rui Jerusalem than gai khou,",
            "Neilah na bam e, ram gai khou tei.",
            "Ai ni bam ni e, ramgai khou tei.",
            "Alungh khou hei ningtan makge.",
            "",
            "4. Lungh neila, duidai paeng poubaomei bampui ram,",
            "Neih lev bw lev gaanchuanga ni mak;",
            "Lung rianra mei hei nai dat lak khe,",
            "Lauziu nah rui gaan gailou e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
